msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2163 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2172
#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3135
msgid "Social login"
msgstr "Accesso con social"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2173
msgid "Sign in with Google, Facebook, and more."
msgstr "Accedi con Google, Facebook e altri."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2193
msgid "Webhook secret"
msgstr "Segreto del webhook"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2200 includes/Admin/Settings.php:3554
msgid "Shared secret"
msgstr "Segreto condiviso"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2201
msgid ""
"Verifies inbound access requests only. Outgoing webhooks are signed with the "
"per-endpoint secret set under Outbound endpoints."
msgstr ""
"Verifica solo le richieste di accesso in entrata. I webhook in uscita sono "
"firmati con il segreto specifico per endpoint impostato in Endpoint in "
"uscita."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2208
msgid "Signature verification"
msgstr "Verifica della firma"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2221 includes/Admin/Settings.php:3603
msgid "Require replay-proof webhook signatures"
msgstr "Richiedi firme dei webhook a prova di replay"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2222 includes/Admin/Settings.php:3604
msgid ""
"On by default: only the timestamped signature scheme (with an X-BuddyNext-"
"Timestamp header) is accepted and the older body-only scheme is rejected. "
"The body-only scheme cannot be replay-checked, so a captured request stays "
"valid indefinitely. Turn this OFF only while migrating a service that still "
"sends body-only signatures, and re-enable it once every caller sends a "
"timestamp."
msgstr ""
"Attivo per impostazione predefinita: viene accettato solo lo schema di firma "
"con marcatura temporale (con l'intestazione X-BuddyNext-Timestamp) e viene "
"rifiutato il vecchio schema basato solo sul corpo. Lo schema basato solo sul "
"corpo non può essere verificato contro i replay, quindi una richiesta "
"intercettata resta valida indefinitamente. Disattivalo solo durante la "
"migrazione di un servizio che invia ancora firme basate solo sul corpo, e "
"riattivalo non appena ogni chiamante invia una marcatura temporale."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2230 includes/Admin/Settings.php:3610
msgid "Allow role changes from outside"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2231 includes/Admin/Settings.php:3611
msgid ""
"Off by default. When on, a signed request can set a member to community "
"admin, moderator or member. Leave it off unless a service you run needs it: "
"your shared secret authorises every action, and this is the most powerful "
"one. Plans, abilities and credits work either way."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2239 includes/Admin/Settings.php:3617
msgid "Create an account for a new buyer"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2240 includes/Admin/Settings.php:3618
msgid ""
"Off by default. When on, a signed request that gives a plan, an ability or "
"credits to an email address with no account creates the member (as a new "
"member, never an administrator) and emails them a link to set their "
"password. Use it when you take payment in another tool and connect it with "
"Make or Zapier. Accounts are only created from requests signed with your "
"secret."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2434
msgid ""
"The pasted Apple .p8 private key could not be read, so the previous key was "
"kept. Paste the full file contents, including the BEGIN and END lines."
msgstr ""
"Non è stato possibile leggere la chiave privata Apple .p8 incollata, quindi "
"è stata mantenuta la chiave precedente. Incolla il contenuto completo del "
"file, incluse le righe BEGIN e END."

